            <text>&lt;p&gt;"The Project Description below will be used to fill out multiple forms, including the NOAA / DOC approval process. Place emphasis on the problem, mission impact, solution and deficiencies corrected in a way that supports the Ranking Factor and Severity Index selected. Write this paragraph to a wide audience who do not know the mission of your site.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note 1: If your project corrects an agency-identified problem, include the findings and the source in your justification.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note 2: If this is a Ranking Factor "Energy &amp;amp; Sustainable Building Capital Improvement&amp;rdquo; project with a full Return on Investment (ROI) within five (5) years, show all ROI calculations in this section. Energy &amp;amp; Sustainable Building Capital Improvement Projects with a fully documented ROI within five (5) years will receive an additional 50 points during project scoring.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
            <type display_value="Info Box Blue">753f88a80f930000b12e6903cfe01206</type>
